   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Anti-korruption, vBalkan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet avser att st&#xE4;rka kampen mot korruption i syd&#xF6;stra Europa genom utveckling av nationella planer f&#xF6;r detta &#xE4;ndam&#xE5;l samt etablerande av strukturer f&#xF6;r att p&#xE5;driva och f&#xF6;lja arbetet inom detta omr&#xE5;de. Projktet genomf&#xF6;rs av Europar&#xE5;det.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is aiming at strengthening the fight against corruption in South-Eastern Europe through the development of so called National Action Plans for this purpose and the establishment of structures for monitoring the process. The project will be implemented through the Council of Europe.</narrative>
  </description>
